{
  "name": "20 · Festival Offer Broadcaster (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 20 · Festival Offer Broadcaster\nThree days before each festival in your sheet, AI turns **your own offer** into one festive line, emails it to you for **approval**, and only after you click Approve sends it as a WhatsApp template to customers who opted in.\n\n**Setup (20 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Festivals**: Date (yyyy-mm-dd), Festival, Offer, Audience tag. Tab **Customers**: Name, Phone, Opt-in (yes/no), Tags. Tab **Broadcast log**.\n2. WhatsApp: marketing messages need an **approved template**. In Meta → WhatsApp Manager create a Marketing template with 3 body variables, e.g. `Hello {{1}} ji, Happy {{2}}! {{3}} – YOUR BUSINESS NAME. Reply STOP to opt out.` Replace YOUR_TEMPLATE_NAME.\n3. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup).\n4. Gmail nodes: add a **Gmail OAuth2** credential. Replace YOUR_OWNER_EMAIL.\n5. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nOnly message people who said yes to offers. The AI cannot add discounts: it only rewrites your Offer text.",
        "height": 742,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "9898c35d-78f3-4de7-b0f9-7b9469f5e3cc",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 9,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2de9947f-af96-4943-af92-4b7214e17ba8",
      "name": "Daily 9 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
